  "category": "beach",
  "positioning": "Beachfront resort on the Caribbean in Cancun's Hotel Zone, listed on the official Kempinski site as Kempinski Hotel Cancun",
  "best_for": [
    "Travelers who want a beachfront stay with pools, a hot tub and racquet sports",
